        "resolution": "Control uncertain predicate now includes typed cleanup_unknown code as well as unknown disposition. Same real-wire cooperative table tests both wires, using cleanup_unknown/not_submitted; author reports original candidate control RED followed by2/2 GREEN. No unsubmitted weakening remains in this newly joined path."
